# Live site vs sandbox

This repo has two workspaces. **Default to the live site.** Only use the sandbox when the user asks.

## Live site (GitHub Pages)

Edit these files at the project root: `index.html`, `styles.css`, `education.html`, `publications.html`, `press.html`.

Changes here can be committed and deployed.

## Sandbox (local drafts only)

Path: `experiments.local/` (gitignored; never commit or deploy).

Starter copy of the current site: `experiments.local/sandbox/`.

Treat any of these as a request to work **only** in `experiments.local/` (usually `experiments.local/sandbox/` unless they name another subfolder):

- "sandbox"
- "in the sandbox"
- "experimental" / "experiment"
- "draft" / "drafts"
- "not the live site"

Do not copy sandbox work onto the live site unless the user explicitly asks to promote it.
